    "summary": "Portrait of Hajjí Mulla Aghasí; single-page painting mounted on album folio. The figure is shown kneeling while reading a page of Persian poetry. He wears a tall black hat and his robe is dark green, held with a red and white striped sash. Inscribed. Album contains 19 paintings of Persian costumes. \r\nInk and opaque watercolour on paper. Album bound in green leather with gold gilt trim, with pages of gold trim. Includes loose letter (in French) on thin blue paper describing contents and addressed to recipient.",
